flowchart TD
    A[Service order booked / diagnosed] --> B[Add product line and ServicePartRequirement]
    B --> C[Check active Shop stock]
    C --> D{Required quantity fully available?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Reserve required quantity]
    D -- No --> F[Reserve available quantity]
    F --> G[Set ServiceOrder to AWAITING_PARTS when blocking]
    F --> H[Create ServiceProcurementRequest for this sourcing round]
    H --> I[Add request lines linked to ServicePartRequirement]
    I --> J[Capture/upload reference photos and compatibility notes]
    J --> K[Publish into Shop-wide Service Parts Purchase Queue]
    K --> L[Buyer reviews by ServiceOrder ID, priority and needed-by date]
    L --> M[Create/reuse SupplierPurchase]
    M --> N[Allocate SupplierPurchaseLine to one or more request lines]
    N --> O[Record source/order URL, order date, ETA and tracking URL]
    O --> P[Track status / ETA changes in event timeline]
    P --> Q[Receive partial or full delivery]
    Q --> R[Record actual accepted whole-unit quantity]
    R --> S[Post PURCHASE_RECEIPT_IN]
    S --> T[Reserve allocated received quantity for linked requirement]
    T --> U[Recalculate request and request-line statuses]
    U --> V{All blocking requirements fully reserved?}
    E --> V
    V -- No --> P
    V -- Yes --> W[Employee authenticates: Resume repair]
    W --> X[ServiceOrder returns to IN_PROGRESS]
    X --> Y[Repair completed: FIXED]
    Y --> Z[Reservations remain active]
    Z --> AA[Full payment; balance reaches zero]
    AA --> AB[Consume reserved stock]
    AB --> AC[Later physical handover: PICKED]

    G --> AC[Cancel service / requirement]
    AC --> AD[Release active reservations]
    AD --> AE[Received parts remain Shop stock unless separately returned]

    K -.-> AF[Later discovery: create new request number for same ServiceOrder]
    AF -.-> I
